INFO 09-15 16:07:46 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-8d3a0b8ff7cc40c08ca1ab392d2d4e1c-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nI sigh the lack of many a thing I sought,\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nIf thou couldst answer 'This fair child of mine\nExcusing thy sins more than thy sins are;\nSo long lives this and this gives life to thee.\n'Tis not enough that through the cloud thou break,\nTo that sweet thief which sourly robs from me.\nAfter a thousand victories once foil'd,\nBut when in thee time's furrows I behold,\nSings this to thee: 'thou single wilt prove none.'\nProfitless usurer, why dost thou use\nHow many a holy and obsequious tear\nYet him for this my love no whit disdaineth;\nFrom sullen earth, sings hymns at heaven's gate;\nTo show me worthy of thy sweet respect:\nMuch liker than your painted counterfeit:\nWhen lofty trees I see barren of leaves\nWill play the tyrants to the very same\nNeither in inward worth nor outward fair,\nI will not praise that purpose not to sell.\nClouds and eclipses stain both moon and sun,\nFor to thy sensual fault I bring in sense--\nAnd many maiden gardens yet unset\nThou of thyself thy sweet self dost deceive.\nYet in these thoughts myself almost despising,\nWhen day's oppression is not eased by night,\nAnd dig deep trenches in thy beauty's field,\nSuch heavenly touches ne'er touch'd earthly faces.'\nMay make seem bare, in wanting words to show it,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 236777, 53647, 506, 6220, 529, 1551, 496, 3210, 564, 15023, 236764, 107, 22550, 529, 69783, 672, 21820, 13935, 990, 236761, 107, 2859, 35627, 1451, 540, 3890, 756, 2094, 5888, 1919, 529, 10701, 107, 73569, 3091, 21820, 44769, 919, 1082, 21820, 44769, 659, 236793, 107