INFO 09-15 16:08:20 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-b137db84749b4c2f866f0eaf4b8368f7-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nSo long lives this and this gives life to thee.\nOr any of these all, or all, or more,\nIs but the seemly raiment of my heart,\nYet him for this my love no whit disdaineth;\nUnless thou take that honour from thy name:\nWhose strength's abundance weakens his own heart.\nThou gavest me thine, not to give back again.\nI may not evermore acknowledge thee,\nAnd dig deep trenches in thy beauty's field,\nBut since she prick'd thee out for women's pleasure,\nTo hideous winter and confounds him there;\nHow many a holy and obsequious tear\nFor to thy sensual fault I bring in sense--\nAs any mother's child, though not so bright\nWhen I do count the clock that tells the time,\n'Tis not enough that through the cloud thou break,\nWhat acceptable audit canst thou leave?\nI sigh the lack of many a thing I sought,\nWere an all-eating shame and thriftless praise.\nLike to the lark at break of day arising\nAnd look upon myself and curse my fate,\nAnd with old woes new wail my dear time's waste:\nFor at a frown they in their glory die.\nThe eyes, 'fore duteous, now converted are\nAs interest of the dead, which now appear\nThe world will be thy widow and still weep\nHung with the trophies of my lovers gone,\nMy body is the frame wherein 'tis held,\nAnd shalt by fortune once more re-survey<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 4324, 1440, 6176, 672, 532, 672, 5021, 1972, 531, 44543, 236761, 107, 3524, 1027, 529, 1239, 784, 236764, 653, 784, 236764, 653, 919, 236764, 107, 4602, 840, 506, 4483, 586, 1459, 2277, 529, 1041, 3710, 236764, 107, 40524, 1515, 573, 672, 1041, 2765, 951, 43551, 125688, 1064, 23