INFO 09-15 16:08:21 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-76b6a55a60a04906b9ee83bebc342feb-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhose fresh repair if now thou not renewest,\nThose hours, that with gentle work did frame\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nWhat acceptable audit canst thou leave?\nAs those gold candles fix'd in heaven's air:\nSave that my soul's imaginary sight\nO, learn to read what silent love hath writ:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFor to thy sensual fault I bring in sense--\nThat 'gainst thyself thou stick'st not to conspire.\nYou should live twice; in it and in my rhyme.\nGilding the object whereupon it gazeth;\nSo I, made lame by fortune's dearest spite,\nAnd summer's green all girded up in sheaves\nGreat princes' favourites their fair leaves spread\nIf thou survive my well-contented day,\nLet them say more than like of hearsay well;\nThe world will wail thee, like a makeless wife;\nHerein lives wisdom, beauty and increase:\nNor it nor no remembrance what it was:\nThat am debarr'd the benefit of rest?\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nAgainst this coming end you should prepare,\nAnd they are rich and ransom all ill deeds.\nBy unions married, do offend thine ear,\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nTo hear with eyes belongs to love's fine wit.\nAnd wear their brave state out of memory;\nWhen I consider every thing that grows<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2825, 888, 5756, 11790, 768, 1492, 35627, 711, 12495, 598, 236764, 107, 28587, 3885, 236764, 600, 607, 14617, 981, 1602, 5528, 107, 236776, 880, 528, 37766, 236764, 784, 756, 236754, 1303, 236789, 528, 914, 23689, 236764, 107, 3689, 20626, 24391, 740, 540, 35627, 5264, 236881, 1