INFO 09-15 16:08:21 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-fb8ffc551c2e4a5cb5463a736c04d875-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nThat due of many now is thine alone:\nWhen sparkling stars twire not thou gild'st the even.\nThat thou among the wastes of time must go,\nPresents thy shadow to my sightless view,\nThou mayst call thine when thou from youth convertest.\nWill be a tatter'd weed, of small worth held:\nVaunt in their youthful sap, at height decrease,\nTill whatsoever star that guides my moving\nFor shame! deny that thou bear'st love to any,\nI make my love engrafted to this store:\nThat thou among the wastes of time must go,\nThy beauty's form in table of my heart;\nThy unused beauty must be tomb'd with thee,\nAnd being frank she lends to those are free.\nThen can I grieve at grievances foregone,\nWho with his fear is put besides his part,\nWhich, used, lives th' executor to be.\nVaunt in their youthful sap, at height decrease,\nAnd perspective it is the painter's art.\nThe sad account of fore-bemoaned moan,\nWhich hides your life and shows not half your parts.\nYou should live twice; in it and in my rhyme.\nWith ugly rack on his celestial face,\nBearing thy heart, which I will keep so chary\nWith what I most enjoy contented least;\nMaking a couplement of proud compare,\nTill whatsoever star that guides my moving\nWhich I new pay as if not paid before.\nThat due of many now is thine alone:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 6372, 2779, 529, 1551, 1492, 563, 162531, 7057, 236787, 107, 4420, 52160, 8197, 3615, 750, 711, 35627, 220745, 236789, 540, 506, 1581, 236761, 107, 6372, 35627, 3571, 506, 45062, 529, 990, 1921, 817, 236764, 107, 236791, 8872, 21820, 13024, 531, 1041, 14186, 1933, 1927, 236764