INFO 09-15 16:08:31 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-d77fb4407dd5433a9fc06bc5de4d5df1-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nTo him that bears the strong offence's cross.\nWhere all the treasure of thy lusty days,\nO, change thy thought, that I may change my mind!\nOf plagues, of dearths, or seasons' quality;\nWhich in thy breast doth live, as thine in me:\nMy body is the frame wherein 'tis held,\nLest my bewailed guilt should do thee shame,\nAs fast as thou shalt wane, so fast thou growest\nAnd all in war with Time for love of you,\nOr else of thee this I prognosticate:\nIf thou survive my well-contented day,\nWhy lovest thou that which thou receivest not gladly,\nThough thou repent, yet I have still the loss:\nAnd in themselves their pride lies buried,\nAnd make the earth devour her own sweet brood;\nSave that my soul's imaginary sight\nOr else receivest with pleasure thine annoy?\nHow much more praise deserved thy beauty's use,\nFull many a glorious morning have I seen\nBut not to tell of good or evil luck,\nAnon permit the basest clouds to ride\nMine eye hath play'd the painter and hath stell'd\nHow can I then be elder than thou art?\nWith all triumphant splendor on my brow;\nAnd sable curls all silver'd o'er with white;\nThat this huge stage presenteth nought but shows\nThese poor rude lines of thy deceased lover,\nNor can thy shame give physic to my grief;\nI summon up remembrance of things past,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2021, 1515, 600, 29402, 506, 3188, 39906, 236789, 236751, 4071, 236761, 107, 10936, 784, 506, 37120, 529, 21820, 47150, 236762, 2668, 236764, 107, 236806, 236764, 2352, 21820, 3305, 236764, 600, 564, 1149, 2352, 1041, 3666, 236888, 107, 4088, 223147, 236764, 529, 193