INFO 09-15 16:08:32 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-0fe7a6e1d3ba4d3ea424efa9d9c6daf7-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nMine be thy love and thy love's use their treasure.\nWith all triumphant splendor on my brow;\nThat beauty still may live in thine or thee.\nAnd die as fast as they see others grow;\nAnd dig deep trenches in thy beauty's field,\nHim in thy course untainted do allow\nAnd make me travel forth without my cloak,\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nIs but the seemly raiment of my heart,\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nMay make seem bare, in wanting words to show it,\nAnd loathsome canker lives in sweetest bud.\nSo long as men can breathe or eyes can see,\nAnd from the forlorn world his visage hide,\nWhereon the stars in secret influence comment;\nIs it for fear to wet a widow's eye\nSo should the lines of life that life repair,\nBut as the marigold at the sun's eye,\nAnd heavily from woe to woe tell o'er\nLord of my love, to whom in vassalage\nCalls back the lovely April of her prime:\nAnd weep afresh love's long since cancell'd woe,\nBut flowers distill'd though they with winter meet,\nAnd that unfair which fairly doth excel:\nWho all in one, one pleasing note do sing:\nyet mortal looks adore his beauty still,\nWhy lovest thou that which thou receivest not gladly,\nBy unions married, do offend thine ear,\nBy adding one thing to my purpose nothing.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 61781, 577, 21820, 2765, 532, 21820, 2765, 236789, 236751, 1161, 910, 37120, 236761, 107, 3497, 784, 124294, 152912, 580, 1041, 69135, 236793, 107, 6372, 9899, 2036, 1149, 3892, 528, 162531, 653, 44543, 236761, 107, 3133, 1778, 618, 4592, 618, 901, 1460, 3496, 2171, 236793, 107, 3133