 19%|█▉        | 190/1000 [00:46<01:18, 10.38it/s]INFO 09-15 16:08:32 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-249e34af9cc540e5912b5f237bf6e6c1-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhy didst thou promise such a beauteous day,\nO, let my books be then the eloquence\nBut not to tell of good or evil luck,\nThe sad account of fore-bemoaned moan,\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nWhich in thy breast doth live, as thine in me:\nTo that sweet thief which sourly robs from me.\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nIs but the seemly raiment of my heart,\nYet in these thoughts myself almost despising,\nStirr'd by a painted beauty to his verse,\nWho for thyself art so unprovident.\nFlatter the mountain-tops with sovereign eye,\nAnd in mine own love's strength seem to decay,\nAnd many maiden gardens yet unset\nIf I could write the beauty of your eyes\nBut out, alack! he was but one hour mine;\nWhere I may not remove nor be removed.\nSo then I am not lame, poor, nor despised,\nAnd all the rest forgot for which he toil'd:\nWhich, used, lives th' executor to be.\nAnd burn the long-lived phoenix in her blood;\nThat hath his windows glazed with thine eyes.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nThen what could death do, if thou shouldst depart,\nYet eyes this cunning want to grace their art;\nAnd see thy blood warm when thou feel'st it cold.\nTo work my mind, when body's work's expired:\nLeese but their show; their substance still lives sweet.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 11355, 1602, 540, 35627, 14468, 1288, 496, 210820, 1328, 806, 1719, 236764, 107, 236806, 236764, 1531, 1041, 6249, 577, 1299, 506, 184980, 107, 4573, 711, 531, 3442, 529, 1535, 653, 16966, 15597, 236764, 107, 818, 11019, 2881, 529