INFO 09-15 16:08:32 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-6fc79fb3938e4150a3eac04b4792750a-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nPointing to each his thunder, rain and wind,\nHath dear religious love stol'n from mine eye\nWhich erst from heat did canopy the herd,\nStealing unseen to west with this disgrace:\nAnd you must live, drawn by your own sweet skill.\nThou mayst call thine when thou from youth convertest.\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nThat on himself such murderous shame commits.\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nIn singleness the parts that thou shouldst bear.\nAs a decrepit father takes delight\nFlatter the mountain-tops with sovereign eye,\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nWithout thy help by me be borne alone.\nLook in thy glass, and tell the face thou viewest\nGreat princes' favourites their fair leaves spread\nAnd every fair from fair sometime declines,\nHow much more praise deserved thy beauty's use,\nTo show me worthy of thy sweet respect:\nMore than that tongue that more hath more express'd.\nMay make seem bare, in wanting words to show it,\nWhen every private widow well may keep\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nThat on himself such murderous shame commits.\nWhich this, Time's pencil, or my pupil pen,\nBut as the marigold at the sun's eye,\nMakes black night beauteous and her old face new.\nAnd sable curls all silver'd o'er with white;<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 227805, 531, 1546, 914, 41796, 236764, 6927, 532, 6573, 236764, 107, 236814, 651, 23348, 12352, 2765, 64569, 236789, 236749, 699, 107