 37%|███▋      | 371/1000 [01:27<02:11,  4.78it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:14 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-0db2b844208b4800b7ec93dcab9fb457-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhere all the treasure of thy lusty days,\nHerein lives wisdom, beauty and increase:\nLo! thus, by day my limbs, by night my mind,\nAnd by a part of all thy glory live.\nAnd stretched metre of an antique song:\nMine eye hath play'd the painter and hath stell'd\nThou art the grave where buried love doth live,\nWhen day's oppression is not eased by night,\nWhose speechless song, being many, seeming one,\nTheir images I loved I view in thee,\nWhose strength's abundance weakens his own heart.\nCalls back the lovely April of her prime:\nAs I, not for myself, but for thee will;\nLook, what an unthrift in the world doth spend\nNeither in inward worth nor outward fair,\nStrikes each in each by mutual ordering,\nThat's for thyself to breed another thee,\nAnd that fresh blood which youngly thou bestowest\nWhich, used, lives th' executor to be.\nThat use is not forbidden usury,\nAs, thou being mine, mine is thy good report.\nBut since he died and poets better prove,\nThis wish I have; then ten times happy me!Till whatsoever star that guides my moving\nMaking a couplement of proud compare,\nWill play the tyrants to the very same\nThen can I drown an eye, unused to flow,\nMark how one string, sweet husband to another,\nOr say with princes if it shall go well,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 10936, 784, 506, 37120, 529, 21820, 47150, 236762, 2668, 236764, 107, 8291, 495, 6176, 23069, 236764, 9899, 532, 3553, 236787, 107, 9520, 236888, 5478, 236764, 684, 1719, 1041, 50917, 236764, 684, 3446, 1041, 3666, 236764, 107, 3133, 684, 496, 912, 52