 41%|████      | 412/1000 [01:38<03:26,  2.85it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:24 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-28a8bc51ade245ab887794a90d37203c-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nAn eye more bright than theirs, less false in rolling,\nIntend a zealous pilgrimage to thee,\nAs interest of the dead, which now appear\nA woman's face with Nature's own hand painted\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nNo longer yours than you yourself here live:\nIs but the seemly raiment of my heart,\nBearing thy heart, which I will keep so chary\nAnd loathsome canker lives in sweetest bud.\nWhich though it alter not love's sole effect,\nIntend a zealous pilgrimage to thee,\nDoth homage to his new-appearing sight,\nThe one by toil, the other to complain\nThen, were not summer's distillation left,\nFind no determination: then you were\nSo thou through windows of thine age shall see\nThy bosom is endeared with all hearts,\nA woman's face with Nature's own hand painted\nLooking on darkness which the blind do see\nThen being ask'd where all thy beauty lies,\nAttending on his golden pilgrimage;\nIn singleness the parts that thou shouldst bear.\nPluck the keen teeth from the fierce tiger's jaws,\nBe not self-will'd, for thou art much too fair\nThou of thyself thy sweet self dost deceive.\nAs those gold candles fix'd in heaven's air:\nThose hours, that with gentle work did frame\nYet doth it steal sweet hours from love's delight.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 2267, 7068, 919, 7804, 1082, 61877, 236764, 2344, 2416, 528, 19519, 236764, 107, 3898, 643, 496, 190303, 88762, 531, 44543, 236764, 107, 2205, 2142, 529, 506, 65