 44%|████▍     | 438/1000 [01:38<00:52, 10.75it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:25 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-6c4e86343ed34b05b305fdad91f08065-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nFlatter the mountain-tops with sovereign eye,\nStrikes each in each by mutual ordering,\nWhose speechless song, being many, seeming one,\nBeauty o'ersnow'd and bareness every where:\nThy bosom is endeared with all hearts,\nO, let my books be then the eloquence\nThen happy I, that love and am beloved\nHaply I think on thee, and then my state,\nThou shouldst print more, not let that copy die.\nAnd every fair from fair sometime declines,\nDisdains the tillage of thy husbandry?\nSave breed, to brave him when he takes thee hence.\nFor shame! deny that thou bear'st love to any,\nBut from thine eyes my knowledge I derive,\nThat thou consumest thyself in single life?\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAttending on his golden pilgrimage;\nMore than that tongue that more hath more express'd.\nWhich happies those that pay the willing loan;\nAttending on his golden pilgrimage;\nWith all triumphant splendor on my brow;\nBe not self-will'd, for thou art much too fair\nYet him for this my love no whit disdaineth;\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nAnd yet methinks I have astronomy,\nBut that I hope some good conceit of thine\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nI make my love engrafted to this store:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 6720, 2737, 506, 10565, 236772, 71133, 607, 43284, 7068, 236764, 107, 155124, 10877, 1546, 528, 1546, 684, 21281, 24121, 236764, 107, 2825, 888, 160132, 5410, 236764, 1646, 1551, 236764, 109785, 886, 236764, 107, 74722, 512, 236789, 616, 