 52%|█████▏    | 521/1000 [01:59<01:39,  4.82it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:45 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-c276a33392874757869b7b5d005a8646-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAnd weep afresh love's long since cancell'd woe,\nBy chance or nature's changing course untrimm'd;\nWhen I perceive that men as plants increase,\nIn thy soul's thought, all naked, will bestow it;\nI summon up remembrance of things past,\nThen being ask'd where all thy beauty lies,\nThe world will wail thee, like a makeless wife;\nDoth homage to his new-appearing sight,\nLo! thus, by day my limbs, by night my mind,\nAnd for a woman wert thou first created;\nBut when from highmost pitch, with weary car,\nAnd then believe me, my love is as fair\nWhich husbandry in honour might uphold\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThy adverse party is thy advocate--\nAuthorizing thy trespass with compare,\nExcusing thy sins more than thy sins are;\nAnd puts apparel on my tatter'd loving,\nAnd heavily from woe to woe tell o'er\nBe not self-will'd, for thou art much too fair\nDuty so great, which wit so poor as mine\nDisdains the tillage of thy husbandry?\nFind no determination: then you were\nThat am debarr'd the benefit of rest?\nFor beauty's pattern to succeeding men.\nWhich though it alter not love's sole effect,\nWhich bounteous gift thou shouldst in bounty cherish:\nIs from the book of honour razed quite,\nWhen I perceive that men as plants increase,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 3133, 137531, 228588, 2765, 236789, 236751, 1440, 2338, 27697, 236789, 236753, 154122, 236764, 107, 2292, 6584, 653, 4135, 236789, 236751, 9199, 3003, 2225, 4966, 236757, 236789, 236753, 236793, 107, 4420, 564, 48672, 600, 1758, 618, 6485, 3553, 