 54%|█████▍    | 538/1000 [01:59<00:41, 11.24it/s]INFO 09-15 16:09:46 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-3154d58f04f74f2ba5b63ae745fa2e09-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nTo march in ranks of better equipage:\nTo dry the rain on my storm-beaten face,\nAnd fortify yourself in your decay\nAnd dost him grace when clouds do blot the heaven:\nThat on himself such murderous shame commits.\nTo see his active child do deeds of youth,\nWho for thyself art so unprovident.\nThen can I grieve at grievances foregone,\nSave breed, to brave him when he takes thee hence.\nWhich to repair should be thy chief desire.\nWhen I behold the violet past prime,\nFrom his low tract and look another way:\nBut wherefore do not you a mightier way\nLook, whom she best endow'd she gave the more;\nLeese but their show; their substance still lives sweet.\nMake war upon this bloody tyrant, Time?\nProving his beauty by succession thine!\nWhy didst thou promise such a beauteous day,\nThey draw but what they see, know not the heart.\nNor it nor no remembrance what it was:\nMore than that tongue that more hath more express'd.\nSings this to thee: 'thou single wilt prove none.'\nOf plagues, of dearths, or seasons' quality;\nThy youth's proud livery, so gazed on now,\nSo thou, thyself out-going in thy noon,\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nAs, thou being mine, mine is thy good report.\nFor thy sweet love remember'd such wealth brings\nCalls back the lovely April of her prime:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2021, 14868, 528, 26867, 529, 2480, 4653, 676, 236787, 107, 2021, 6299, 506, 6927, 580, 1041, 12978, 236772, 1553, 6793, 3392, 236764, 107, 3133, 7845, 1891, 5869, 528, 822, 17538, 107, 3133, 24873, 1515, 20499, 1056