 68%|██████▊   | 676/1000 [02:30<00:44,  7.25it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:17 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-15febd5797744486b4bdeca64ba0f314-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWeary with toil, I haste me to my bed,\nUnless thou take that honour from thy name:\nBut not to tell of good or evil luck,\nThe region cloud hath mask'd him from me now.\nMine eyes have drawn thy shape, and thine for me\nThe age to come would say 'This poet lies:\nMy body is the frame wherein 'tis held,\nAre windows to my breast, where-through the sun\nI summon up remembrance of things past,\nyet mortal looks adore his beauty still,\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nEven so my sun one early morn did shine\nIf all were minded so, the times should cease\nNot from the stars do I my judgment pluck;\nAnd perspective it is the painter's art.\nYet, do thy worst, old Time: despite thy wrong,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nCalls back the lovely April of her prime:\nAnd yet methinks I have astronomy,\nExceeded by the height of happier men.\nWhich I new pay as if not paid before.\nWhere wasteful Time debateth with Decay,\nSings this to thee: 'thou single wilt prove none.'\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nSweets with sweets war not, joy delights in joy.\nAs interest of the dead, which now appear\nAnd with old woes new wail my dear time's waste:\nWhose strength's abundance weakens his own heart.\nDie single, and thine image dies with thee.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 103664, 236762, 607, 141001, 236764, 564, 104337, 786, 531, 1041, 4086, 236764, 107, 71520, 35627, 1769, 600, 20488, 699, 21820, 1463, 236787, 107, 4573, 711, 531, 3442, 529, 1535, 653, 16966, 15597, 236764, 107, 818, 4128, 6425, 46440, 7