 78%|███████▊  | 781/1000 [02:51<00:21, 10.18it/s]INFO 09-15 16:10:38 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-fdafdd291c614af5b10c6de20cc83975-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nThen what could death do, if thou shouldst depart,\nYet eyes this cunning want to grace their art;\nThen let not winter's ragged hand deface\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nBorne on the bier with white and bristly beard,\nWhere all the treasure of thy lusty days,\nThe one by toil, the other to complain\nThe bounteous largess given thee to give?\nBut thy eternal summer shall not fade\nThat heals the wound and cures not the disgrace:\nBut as the marigold at the sun's eye,\nAnd they are rich and ransom all ill deeds.\nBut when from highmost pitch, with weary car,\nSo should my papers yellow'd with their age\nAnd see thy blood warm when thou feel'st it cold.\nBut day doth daily draw my sorrows longer\nFor precious friends hid in death's dateless night,\nNow see what good turns eyes for eyes have done:\nResembling sire and child and happy mother\nO' let me, true in love, but truly write,\nWhen in eternal lines to time thou growest:\nO' let me, true in love, but truly write,\nEven so my sun one early morn did shine\nExceeded by the height of happier men.\nBut do not so; I love thee in such sort\nWith means more blessed than my barren rhyme?\nTo witness duty, not to show my wit:\nSo long as youth and thou are of one date;\nShall sum my count and make my old excuse,'<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 11407, 1144, 1451, 4355, 776, 236764, 768, 35627, 1374, 540, 5118, 236764, 107, 40524, 6114, 672, 112018, 1461, 531, 20499, 910, 1610, 236793, 107, 11407, 1531, 711, 7208, 236789, 236751, 134880, 1526, 1096, 792, 107, 3771, 276