INFO 09-15 16:11:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-2287126e9e884b79b7c1c2647ff39560-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nBut I forbid thee one most heinous crime:\nWhen I behold the violet past prime,\nThy beauty's form in table of my heart;\nIs but the seemly raiment of my heart,\nPresume not on thy heart when mine is slain;\nNow see what good turns eyes for eyes have done:\nIs it for fear to wet a widow's eye\nWith ugly rack on his celestial face,\nWere an all-eating shame and thriftless praise.\nGrant, if thou wilt, thou art beloved of many,\nWith beauty's treasure, ere it be self-kill'd.\nThe world will wail thee, like a makeless wife;\nFor through the painter must you see his skill,\nLo! in the orient when the gracious light\nWhat acceptable audit canst thou leave?\nHolds in perfection but a little moment,\nWhen day's oppression is not eased by night,\nAs any mother's child, though not so bright\nNot from the stars do I my judgment pluck;\nBut if the while I think on thee, dear friend,\nThat's for thyself to breed another thee,\nMuch liker than your painted counterfeit:\nPresents thy shadow to my sightless view,\nLet them say more than like of hearsay well;\nThou shouldst print more, not let that copy die.\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nPointing to each his thunder, rain and wind,\nThat heaven's air in this huge rondure hems.\nHung with the trophies of my lovers gone,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 4573, 564, 119121, 44543, 886, 1346, 186422, 12158, 236787, 107, 4420, 564, 67028, 506, 39261, 3068, 8355, 236764, 107, 195297, 9899, 236789, 236751, 1183, 528, 2633, 529, 1041, 3710, 236793, 107, 4602, 840, 506, 4483, 586, 1459, 2277, 529, 1041, 3710, 236764, 107, 18160, 2392