 92%|█████████▏| 921/1000 [03:22<00:15,  4.96it/s]INFO 09-15 16:11:09 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-9e357318f29049d2ba8b6339b78bf701-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nExcusing thy sins more than thy sins are;\nSave that my soul's imaginary sight\nTo let base clouds o'ertake me in my way,\nPoints on me graciously with fair aspect\nGilding the object whereupon it gazeth;\nAnd yet methinks I have astronomy,\nAnd die as fast as they see others grow;\nBut things removed that hidden in thee lie!\nHung with the trophies of my lovers gone,\nDevouring Time, blunt thou the lion's paws,\nDo in consent shake hands to torture me;\nMark how one string, sweet husband to another,\nThou art more lovely and more temperate:\nFor precious friends hid in death's dateless night,\nAnd do whate'er thou wilt, swift-footed Time,\nCalls back the lovely April of her prime:\nMy glass shall not persuade me I am old,\nBut since she prick'd thee out for women's pleasure,\nSo thou, thyself out-going in thy noon,\nSo I, for fear of trust, forget to say\nIf ten of thine ten times refigured thee:\nA woman's gentle heart, but not acquainted\nIn thy soul's thought, all naked, will bestow it;\nThen how, when nature calls thee to be gone,\nWith April's first-born flowers, and all things rare\nOr else of thee this I prognosticate:\nFor then my thoughts, from far where I abide,\nOr else receivest with pleasure thine annoy?\nMusic to hear, why hear'st thou music sadly?<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 73569, 3091, 21820, 44769, 919, 1082, 21820, 44769, 659, 236793, 107, 14000, 600, 1041, 12556, 236789, 236751, 47456, 14186, 107, 2021, 1531, 3225, 14958, 512, 236789, 907, 873, 786, 528, 1041, 1595, 236764, 107, 19622, 580, 786, 1681