  0%|          | 0/1000 [00:00<?, ?it/s]INFO 09-15 16:11:46 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-14f981fac9eb4705a1fd63823e7ec66b-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,\nPointing to each his thunder, rain and wind,\nBy chance or nature's changing course untrimm'd;\nWhich bounteous gift thou shouldst in bounty cherish:\nThy adverse party is thy advocate--\nWhich though it alter not love's sole effect,\nThat hath his windows glazed with thine eyes.\nFrom his low tract and look another way:\nThat I in thy abundance am sufficed\nWhat acceptable audit canst thou leave?\nWhich in thy breast doth live, as thine in me:\nLeaving thee living in posterity?\nTo let base clouds o'ertake me in my way,\nTo that sweet thief which sourly robs from me.\nThe sad account of fore-bemoaned moan,\nThat thou among the wastes of time must go,\nThat on himself such murderous shame commits.\nAnd night doth nightly make grief's strength seem stronger.\nLook, whom she best endow'd she gave the more;\nMuch liker than your painted counterfeit:\nIf thou couldst answer 'This fair child of mine\nBut flowers distill'd though they with winter meet,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nBut if thou live, remember'd not to be,\nCalls back the lovely April of her prime:\nMuch liker than your painted counterfeit:\nWith sun and moon, with earth and sea's rich gems,\nDo in consent shake hands to torture me;\nWith beauty's treasure, ere it be self-kill'd.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 31777, 35627, 607, 1237, 42057, 20488, 786, 236764, 107, 227805, 531, 1546, 914, 41796, 236764, 6927, 532, 6573, 236764, 107, 2292, 6584, 653, 4135, 236789, 236751, 9199, 3003, 2225, 4966, 236757, 236789, 236753, 2