INFO 09-15 16:11:46 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-eb2da4086fd44b9d8674244df16dc685-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nLifts up his burning head, each under eye\nAnd you must live, drawn by your own sweet skill.\nWhere wasteful Time debateth with Decay,\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nFor then my thoughts, from far where I abide,\nTo thee I send this written embassage,\nLike to the lark at break of day arising\nWho heaven itself for ornament doth use\nWith April's first-born flowers, and all things rare\nServing with looks his sacred majesty;\nStrikes each in each by mutual ordering,\nWhen every private widow well may keep\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nHow many a holy and obsequious tear\nBut not to tell of good or evil luck,\nEven so my sun one early morn did shine\nBut day by night, and night by day, oppress'd?\nLooking on darkness which the blind do see\nFind no determination: then you were\nTo hideous winter and confounds him there;\nI may not evermore acknowledge thee,\nO, then vouchsafe me but this loving thought:\nMake war upon this bloody tyrant, Time?\nTheirs for their style I'll read, his for his love.'\nHiding thy bravery in their rotten smoke?\nWhich husbandry in honour might uphold\nBut I forbid thee one most heinous crime:\nAnd your sweet semblance to some other give.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 3133, 31817, 1278, 18773, 529, 1041, 12259, 16489, 236764, 107, 236798, 10018, 872, 914, 18830, 2228, 236764, 1546, 1208, 7068, 107, 3133, 611, 1921, 3892, 236764, 9710, 684, 822, 1852, 9380, 12889, 236761, 107, 10936, 128208, 7578, 233416, 1064, 607, 162935, 236764, 107, 22550, 529, 69783, 672, 21820, 13935, 9