INFO 09-15 16:11:57 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-370c54b7109a494888f66cdbe6bd970d-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhich to repair should be thy chief desire.\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nSo flatter I the swart-complexion'd night,\nAll men make faults, and even I in this,\nOr ten times happier, be it ten for one;\nThe world will be thy widow and still weep\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nAnd there reigns love and all love's loving parts,\nThou shouldst print more, not let that copy die.\nVaunt in their youthful sap, at height decrease,\nAnd puts apparel on my tatter'd loving,\nBut if thou live, remember'd not to be,\nBut thy eternal summer shall not fade\nMake thee another self, for love of me,\nWill be a tatter'd weed, of small worth held:\nBy oft predict that I in heaven find:\nWhen I do count the clock that tells the time,\nAnd make me travel forth without my cloak,\nLet them say more than like of hearsay well;\nLook, what an unthrift in the world doth spend\nWhich erst from heat did canopy the herd,\nGilding the object whereupon it gazeth;\nSo then I am not lame, poor, nor despised,\nIn one of thine, from that which thou departest;\nThy end is truth's and beauty's doom and date.\nWill play the tyrants to the very same\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nIf the true concord of well-tuned sounds,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 24249, 531, 11790, 1374, 577, 21820, 9329, 12614, 236761, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 3133, 31817, 1278, 18773, 529, 1041, 12259, 16489, 236764, 107, 4324, 111771, 564, 506, 2353, 661, 236772, 34622, 526, 236789, 236753, 3446, 236764, 107, 3243, 1758,