INFO 09-15 16:11:57 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-f0345c87dad4405abaddacc2b1e2af89-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nThe bounteous largess given thee to give?\nThou shouldst print more, not let that copy die.\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nEven so my sun one early morn did shine\nWhose fresh repair if now thou not renewest,\nSo is it not with me as with that Muse\nMaking a couplement of proud compare,\nFull many a glorious morning have I seen\nAs truth and beauty shall together thrive,\nBy chance or nature's changing course untrimm'd;\nThe painful warrior famoused for fight,\nThat thou no form of thee hast left behind,\nThat hath his windows glazed with thine eyes.\nSo should my papers yellow'd with their age\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nBut that thou none lovest is most evident;\nThou gavest me thine, not to give back again.\nThy merit hath my duty strongly knit,\nIf all were minded so, the times should cease\nWhereon the stars in secret influence comment;\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,\nAgainst the stormy gusts of winter's day\nPresume not on thy heart when mine is slain;\nBut were some child of yours alive that time,\nNow stand you on the top of happy hours,\nBy children's eyes her husband's shape in mind.\nIf from thyself to store thou wouldst convert;\nHung with the trophies of my lovers gone,\nAnd stretched metre of an antique song:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 818, 518, 1522, 654, 806, 3216, 634, 2238, 44543, 531, 2583, 236881, 107, 178651, 1374, 540, 1887, 919, 236764, 711, 1531, 600, 4865, 1778, 236761, 107, 13185, 16126, 532, 15025, 18046, 618, 35627, 110783, 236764, 107, 14986, 834, 1041, 3768, 886, 3649, 62323, 1602, 29369, 107, 2825,