INFO 09-15 16:12:07 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-4cace47e32ea47b88112a1841dc40bde-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nKissing with golden face the meadows green,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nIf all were minded so, the times should cease\nAttending on his golden pilgrimage;\nWhen I do count the clock that tells the time,\nAlthough our undivided loves are one:\nAnd then believe me, my love is as fair\nSo great a sum of sums, yet canst not live?\nMay make seem bare, in wanting words to show it,\nMusic to hear, why hear'st thou music sadly?\nI may not evermore acknowledge thee,\nSuch heavenly touches ne'er touch'd earthly faces.'\nAnd many maiden gardens yet unset\nFor never-resting time leads summer on\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nNor it nor no remembrance what it was:\nFor having traffic with thyself alone,\nI sigh the lack of many a thing I sought,\nWhen I perceive that men as plants increase,\nThou art the grave where buried love doth live,\nFor at a frown they in their glory die.\nWhich hides your life and shows not half your parts.\nRoses have thorns, and silver fountains mud;\nAnd heavily from woe to woe tell o'er\nOr else receivest with pleasure thine annoy?\nOr who is he so fond will be the tomb\nLeese but their show; their substance still lives sweet.\nWishing me like to one more rich in hope,\nFor thy sweet love remember'd such wealth brings<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 174103, 522, 607, 13935, 3392, 506, 101905, 3826, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 2859, 784, 964, 90971, 834, 236764, 506, 2782, 1374, 41013, 107, 5466, 2669, 580, 914, 13935, 88762, 236793, 107, 4420, 564, 776, 1527, 506, 11072, 60