INFO 09-15 16:12:17 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-e2aa33c4f16e43fba1e4b64d37f47dd0-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nFor shame! deny that thou bear'st love to any,\nShifts but his place, for still the world enjoys it;\nThe eyes, 'fore duteous, now converted are\nThen, beauteous niggard, why dost thou abuse\nAnd having climb'd the steep-up heavenly hill,\nBut things removed that hidden in thee lie!\nHow can I then be elder than thou art?\nNo more be grieved at that which thou hast done:\nUpon thyself thy beauty's legacy?\nSo thou through windows of thine age shall see\nThey draw but what they see, know not the heart.\nAnd weep afresh love's long since cancell'd woe,\nThou art thy mother's glass, and she in thee\nThen look I death my days should expiate.\nWhere wasteful Time debateth with Decay,\nGrant, if thou wilt, thou art beloved of many,\nNor can I fortune to brief minutes tell,\nThy unused beauty must be tomb'd with thee,\nWho plead for love and look for recompense\nHast thou, the master-mistress of my passion;\nAnd your sweet semblance to some other give.\nAgainst this coming end you should prepare,\nWhich this, Time's pencil, or my pupil pen,\nWhen I perceive that men as plants increase,\nAnd summer's lease hath all too short a date:\nThou art thy mother's glass, and she in thee\nDo in consent shake hands to torture me;\nBut if thou live, remember'd not to be,\nWhich hides your life and shows not half your parts.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2542, 30720, 236888, 30590, 600, 35627, 10591, 236789, 540, 2765, 531, 1027, 236764, 107, 3138, 10018, 840, 914, 1977, 236764, 573, 2036, 506, 1902, 34132, 625, 236793, 107, 818, 6114, 236764, 756, 1321, 183004, 806, 236764, 1492, 16952, 659,