INFO 09-15 16:12:17 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-5f9572fa3d5648b4892ec3f496f0420c-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAnd that fresh blood which youngly thou bestowest\nThen of thy beauty do I question make,\nRough winds do shake the darling buds of May,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nWho heaven itself for ornament doth use\nBut from thine eyes my knowledge I derive,\nThe sad account of fore-bemoaned moan,\nAs any mother's child, though not so bright\nProving his beauty by succession thine!\nNow stand you on the top of happy hours,\nAh! but those tears are pearl which thy love sheds,\nPresents thy shadow to my sightless view,\nLet them say more than like of hearsay well;\nThen, were not summer's distillation left,\nNor can thy shame give physic to my grief;\nTo hear with eyes belongs to love's fine wit.\nAnd each, though enemies to either's reign,\nI summon up remembrance of things past,\nAnd they are rich and ransom all ill deeds.\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nBut beauty's waste hath in the world an end,\nThis were to be new made when thou art old,\nMore than that tongue that more hath more express'd.\nSo shall those blots that do with me remain\nThen of thy beauty do I question make,\nDevouring Time, blunt thou the lion's paws,\nUnlook'd for joy in that I honour most.\nThen, were not summer's distillation left,\nAs a decrepit father takes delight<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 3133, 600, 5756, 4806, 837, 3184, 586, 35627, 171130, 598, 107, 11407, 529, 21820, 9899, 776, 564, 2934, 1386, 236764, 107, 122700, 29146, 776, 31716, 506, 96018, 43814, 529, 3353, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7