INFO 09-15 16:12:27 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-cee43623bd26421da2d244d64cba222b-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nBeauty o'ersnow'd and bareness every where:\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nAnd that fresh blood which youngly thou bestowest\nAnd stretched metre of an antique song:\nIn thee thy summer, ere thou be distill'd:\nYet doth it steal sweet hours from love's delight.\nMy glass shall not persuade me I am old,\nBut thy eternal summer shall not fade\nAnd sable curls all silver'd o'er with white;\nAnd every fair with his fair doth rehearse\nMakes black night beauteous and her old face new.\nProfitless usurer, why dost thou use\nAnd in themselves their pride lies buried,\nSo then I am not lame, poor, nor despised,\nSweets with sweets war not, joy delights in joy.\nThat on himself such murderous shame commits.\nSave breed, to brave him when he takes thee hence.\nWhich in my bosom's shop is hanging still,\nBut as the marigold at the sun's eye,\nSo I, made lame by fortune's dearest spite,\nFor no man well of such a salve can speak\nMy glass shall not persuade me I am old,\nBut if the while I think on thee, dear friend,\nAnd for a woman wert thou first created;\nDelights to peep, to gaze therein on thee;\nAnd every fair with his fair doth rehearse\nAnd often is his gold complexion dimm'd;\nNor it nor no remembrance what it was:\nThou art the grave where buried love doth live,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 74722, 512, 236789, 616, 2998, 236789, 236753, 532, 13759, 1788, 1418, 1298, 236787, 107, 22550, 529, 69783, 672, 21820, 13935, 990, 236761, 107, 3133, 600, 5756, 4806, 837, 3184, 586, 35627, 171130, 598, 107, 3133, 39349, 58194, 529, 614, 34323, 5410, 236787, 107, 902, 44