INFO 09-15 16:12:27 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-1d72fb53d86445928edb83dec0c5b71d-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAnd summer's lease hath all too short a date:\nThough thou repent, yet I have still the loss:\nThen what could death do, if thou shouldst depart,\nThat I an accessary needs must be\nAs truth and beauty shall together thrive,\nHow far I toil, still farther off from thee.\nRough winds do shake the darling buds of May,\nWere an all-eating shame and thriftless praise.\nTo let base clouds o'ertake me in my way,\nLooking on darkness which the blind do see\nWho plead for love and look for recompense\nTill Nature, as she wrought thee, fell a-doting,\nFor whether beauty, birth, or wealth, or wit,\nAnd that fresh blood which youngly thou bestowest\nThen of thy beauty do I question make,\nThese poor rude lines of thy deceased lover,\nThy merit hath my duty strongly knit,\nHaply I think on thee, and then my state,\nAnd burn the long-lived phoenix in her blood;\nThose hours, that with gentle work did frame\nIs it for fear to wet a widow's eye\nWhen lofty trees I see barren of leaves\nAnd summer's green all girded up in sheaves\nMusic to hear, why hear'st thou music sadly?\nSo should my papers yellow'd with their age\nThen being ask'd where all thy beauty lies,\nO, none but unthrifts! Dear my love, you know\nThe region cloud hath mask'd him from me now.\nWhen I perceive that men as plants increase,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 3133, 5312, 236789, 236751, 20850, 46440, 784, 2311, 2822, 496, 3433, 236787, 107, 31382, 35627, 58163, 236764, 3819, 564, 735, 2036, 506, 3967, 236787, 107, 11407, 1144, 1451, 4355, 776, 236764, 768, 35627, 1374, 540, 5118, 236764, 107, 6372, 564, 614, 2802, 83