 40%|████      | 401/1000 [00:50<01:08,  8.76it/s]INFO 09-15 16:12:37 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-4d682031072c4b8e929b2936efc045b6-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nSo then I am not lame, poor, nor despised,\nThis wish I have; then ten times happy me!And though they be outstripp'd by every pen,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nOr some fierce thing replete with too much rage,\nIntend a zealous pilgrimage to thee,\nBe not self-will'd, for thou art much too fair\nBut I forbid thee one most heinous crime:\nOr who is he so fond will be the tomb\nBy adding one thing to my purpose nothing.\nThen, beauteous niggard, why dost thou abuse\nReserve them for my love, not for their rhyme,\nNature's bequest gives nothing but doth lend,\nUnless thou take that honour from thy name:\nNor it nor no remembrance what it was:\nTill Nature, as she wrought thee, fell a-doting,\nWhose fresh repair if now thou not renewest,\nOr to thyself at least kind-hearted prove:\nWhen that churl Death my bones with dust shall cover,\nLeaving thee living in posterity?\nShifts but his place, for still the world enjoys it;\nAnd loathsome canker lives in sweetest bud.\nAnd all those friends which I thought buried.\nGrant, if thou wilt, thou art beloved of many,\nThen let not winter's ragged hand deface\nAnd they are rich and ransom all ill deeds.\nO, none but unthrifts! Dear my love, you know\nAnd your sweet semblance to some other give.\nBut day by night, and night by day, oppress'd?<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 4324, 1299, 564, 1006, 711, 74907, 236764, 6934, 236764, 6271, 162214, 236764, 107, 2094, 7976, 564, 735, 236793, 1299, 3595, 2782, 5293, 786, 236888, 3133, 3635, 901, 577, 855, 24758, 612, 236789, 2