INFO 09-15 16:12:37 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-4260aa210f634c83b14bdce79a536ab6-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nHung with the trophies of my lovers gone,\nAs, thou being mine, mine is thy good report.\nTo find where your true image pictured lies;\nSo is it not with me as with that Muse\nWhich though it alter not love's sole effect,\nYet him for this my love no whit disdaineth;\nBe not self-will'd, for thou art much too fair\nSets you most rich in youth before my sight,\nTo see his active child do deeds of youth,\nSo great a sum of sums, yet canst not live?\nSeeking that beauteous roof to ruinate\nAnd by addition me of thee defeated,\nIn thy soul's thought, all naked, will bestow it;\nAn eye more bright than theirs, less false in rolling,\nWhen your sweet issue your sweet form should bear.\nTo let base clouds o'ertake me in my way,\nSweets with sweets war not, joy delights in joy.\nBut that thou none lovest is most evident;\nThis were to be new made when thou art old,\nRoses have thorns, and silver fountains mud;\nLike to the lark at break of day arising\nWhich to repair should be thy chief desire.\nFind no determination: then you were\nAnd then believe me, my love is as fair\nGrant, if thou wilt, thou art beloved of many,\nThou art the grave where buried love doth live,\nThen happy I, that love and am beloved\nFrom his low tract and look another way:\nNo longer yours than you yourself here live:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 61625, 607, 506, 93529, 529, 1041, 31881, 8731, 236764, 107, 2205, 236764, 35627, 1646, 10701, 236764, 10701, 563, 21820, 1535, 2072, 236761, 107, 2021, 1586, 1298, 822, 1847, 2471, 56594, 12828, 236793, 107, 4324, 563, 625, 711, 607, 786, 618, 607, 600, 41554,