INFO 09-15 16:12:48 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-7ca291ffea8b4ae4ab3c3a3a2cd0d323-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nO, then vouchsafe me but this loving thought:\nYet doth it steal sweet hours from love's delight.\nTo hear with eyes belongs to love's fine wit.\nAnd all in war with Time for love of you,\nThis wish I have; then ten times happy me!And look upon myself and curse my fate,\nMake thee another self, for love of me,\nAnd all those friends which I thought buried.\nThough in our lives a separable spite,\nDesiring this man's art and that man's scope,\nSings this to thee: 'thou single wilt prove none.'\nIntend a zealous pilgrimage to thee,\nSo should the lines of life that life repair,\nFrom his low tract and look another way:\nFor never-resting time leads summer on\nWhich though it alter not love's sole effect,\nBut I forbid thee one most heinous crime:\nNor can I fortune to brief minutes tell,\nTo thee I send this written embassage,\nFor no man well of such a salve can speak\nThey do but sweetly chide thee, who confounds\nSo shall those blots that do with me remain\nVaunt in their youthful sap, at height decrease,\nUnless thou take that honour from thy name:\nWho plead for love and look for recompense\nAlthough our undivided loves are one:\nAnd every fair from fair sometime declines,\nAnd puts apparel on my tatter'd loving,\nWhen, in disgrace with fortune and men's eyes,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 236806, 236764, 1299, 43096, 12977, 786, 840, 672, 22274, 3305, 236787, 107, 40524, 139092, 625, 36577, 9380, 3885, 699, 2765, 236789, 236751, 14933, 236761, 107, 2021, 6899, 607, 6114, 19681, 531, 2765, 236789, 236751, 5851, 32950, 236761, 107, 3133, 784, 528, 3653, 607, 7578, 573, 