 70%|███████   | 702/1000 [01:21<00:33,  8.78it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-39f976c23cde4724b2ee81b50eb0f6fd-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAttending on his golden pilgrimage;\nSo is it not with me as with that Muse\nAnd dig deep trenches in thy beauty's field,\nCan make you live yourself in eyes of men.\nThat use is not forbidden usury,\nAnd wear their brave state out of memory;\nThat am debarr'd the benefit of rest?\nWhich I new pay as if not paid before.\nSometime too hot the eye of heaven shines,\n'Tis not enough that through the cloud thou break,\nTheirs for their style I'll read, his for his love.'\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nDuty so great, which wit so poor as mine\nWhich husbandry in honour might uphold\nTill then not show my head where thou mayst prove me.\nAnd each, though enemies to either's reign,\nO, let my books be then the eloquence\nWhereon the stars in secret influence comment;\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nThough yet, heaven knows, it is but as a tomb\nThat hath his windows glazed with thine eyes.\nSo flatter I the swart-complexion'd night,\nA woman's face with Nature's own hand painted\nBut out, alack! he was but one hour mine;\nPoints on me graciously with fair aspect\nWith what I most enjoy contented least;\nNo love toward others in that bosom sits\nAh! but those tears are pearl which thy love sheds,\nWhich I new pay as if not paid before.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 5466, 2669, 580, 914, 13935, 88762, 236793, 107, 4324, 563, 625, 711, 607, 786, 618, 607, 600, 41554, 107, 3133, 3137, 5268, 98574, 528, 21820, 9899, 236789, 236751, 2135, 236764, 107, 8574, 1386, 611, 3892, 5869, 528, 6114, 529, 1758, 236761,