 71%|███████   | 711/1000 [01:22<00:30,  9.40it/s]INFO 09-15 16:13:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-a5adc58465904d3ab2175b0ed6edd408-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nThe lovely gaze where every eye doth dwell,\nSo thou through windows of thine age shall see\nMine eyes have drawn thy shape, and thine for me\nReserve them for my love, not for their rhyme,\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nTo see his active child do deeds of youth,\nNeither in inward worth nor outward fair,\nAnd burn the long-lived phoenix in her blood;\nTo change your day of youth to sullied night;\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nTo march in ranks of better equipage:\nBy adding one thing to my purpose nothing.\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nTo find where your true image pictured lies;\nAnd that unfair which fairly doth excel:\nBut if thou live, remember'd not to be,\nI summon up remembrance of things past,\nHerein lives wisdom, beauty and increase:\nWhose speechless song, being many, seeming one,\nThough in our lives a separable spite,\nThis wish I have; then ten times happy me!With sun and moon, with earth and sea's rich gems,\nWhen lofty trees I see barren of leaves\nThen may I dare to boast how I do love thee;\nAnd sable curls all silver'd o'er with white;\nO, none but unthrifts! Dear my love, you know\nAnd there reigns love and all love's loving parts,\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 13185, 16126, 532, 15025, 18046, 618, 35627, 110783, 236764, 107, 818, 14954, 48674, 1298, 1418, 7068, 139092, 38258, 236764, 107, 4324, 35627, 1343, 11665, 529, 162531, 3911, 2863, 1460, 107, 61781, 6114, 735, 9