INFO 09-15 16:13:09 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-3e4242c2cdf746e99f843b9ecc0e01d2-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nA woman's face with Nature's own hand painted\nDesiring this man's art and that man's scope,\nOr else receivest with pleasure thine annoy?\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nTo thee I send this written embassage,\nResembling sire and child and happy mother\nAs those gold candles fix'd in heaven's air:\nThen look I death my days should expiate.\nTo him that bears the strong offence's cross.\nThen being ask'd where all thy beauty lies,\nWhich happies those that pay the willing loan;\nAnd by addition me of thee defeated,\nWhen that churl Death my bones with dust shall cover,\nWhich bounteous gift thou shouldst in bounty cherish:\nHow can I then return in happy plight,\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nSo long lives this and this gives life to thee.\nWithout this, folly, age and cold decay:\nWhich husbandry in honour might uphold\nAll men make faults, and even I in this,\nWhere all the treasure of thy lusty days,\nTill Nature, as she wrought thee, fell a-doting,\nThe sad account of fore-bemoaned moan,\nWhy lovest thou that which thou receivest not gladly,\nTake all my comfort of thy worth and truth.\nTheir images I loved I view in thee,\nAlthough our undivided loves are one:\nPresume not on thy heart when mine is slain;\nO, then vouchsafe me but this loving thought:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 236776, 3875, 236789, 236751, 3392, 607, 15007, 236789, 236751, 1852, 1526, 16715, 107, 3984, 5935, 672, 880, 236789, 236751, 1610, 532, 600, 880, 236789, 236751, 11104, 236764, 107, 3524, 1663, 2252, 648, 598, 607, 17132, 162531, 26259, 236881, 107, 236776, 7921