INFO 09-15 16:13:19 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-5c3b4ad7e9bb4f7b9b1414cb9ccaae69-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nLike to the lark at break of day arising\nIf from thyself to store thou wouldst convert;\nDevouring Time, blunt thou the lion's paws,\nAnd from the forlorn world his visage hide,\nCheered and cheque'd even by the self-same sky,\nWith what I most enjoy contented least;\nAnon permit the basest clouds to ride\nThen being ask'd where all thy beauty lies,\nBut since he died and poets better prove,\nBut I forbid thee one most heinous crime:\nHolds in perfection but a little moment,\nThough yet, heaven knows, it is but as a tomb\nLest my bewailed guilt should do thee shame,\nAnd keep my drooping eyelids open wide,\nAnd die as fast as they see others grow;\nExceeded by the height of happier men.\nThou art more lovely and more temperate:\nMyself corrupting, salving thy amiss,\nThat thou consumest thyself in single life?\nThe bounteous largess given thee to give?\nSo then I am not lame, poor, nor despised,\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,\nBe, as thy presence is, gracious and kind,\nO, therefore, love, be of thyself so wary\nHow far I toil, still farther off from thee.\nWith what I most enjoy contented least;\nAnd make me travel forth without my cloak,\nWhich erst from heat did canopy the herd,\nHarsh featureless and rude, barrenly perish:<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 17729, 531, 506, 218175, 657, 2541, 529, 1719, 27123, 107, 2859, 699, 208224, 883, 531, 4762, 35627, 1093, 540, 7352, 236793, 107, 11062, 114833, 7578, 236764, 63696, 35627, 506, 32329, 236789, 236751, 114386, 236764, 107, 3133, 699, 506, 224103, 2163, 1902, 914, 96236, 16239, 236764, 107, 5239, 3747, 532, 8