INFO 09-15 16:13:19 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-68cdad536771408ba19c3ebcedc7da78-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nBy oft predict that I in heaven find:\nWhich this, Time's pencil, or my pupil pen,\nWith means more blessed than my barren rhyme?\nThou dost beguile the world, unbless some mother.\nAgainst this coming end you should prepare,\nThen, were not summer's distillation left,\nAnd each, though enemies to either's reign,\nLooking on darkness which the blind do see\nDuty so great, which wit so poor as mine\nWhich bounteous gift thou shouldst in bounty cherish:\nIf it were fill'd with your most high deserts?\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nWhen day's oppression is not eased by night,\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,\nMore than that tongue that more hath more express'd.\nAs tender nurse her babe from faring ill.\nI will not praise that purpose not to sell.\nAs those gold candles fix'd in heaven's air:\nThou mayst call thine when thou from youth convertest.\nAnd thou, all they, hast all the all of me.\nThou gavest me thine, not to give back again.\nBut from thine eyes my knowledge I derive,\nThey draw but what they see, know not the heart.\nIn thee thy summer, ere thou be distill'd:\nNow see what good turns eyes for eyes have done:\nThat heaven's air in this huge rondure hems.\nThat heaven's air in this huge rondure hems.\nNor it nor no remembrance what it was:\nI sigh the lack of many a thing I sought,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2292, 39179, 4773, 600, 564, 528, 20808, 1586, 236787, 107, 24249, 672, 236764, 7578, 236789, 236751, 30368, 236764, 653, 1041, 53868, 4306, 236764, 107, 3497, 2820, 919, 31865, 1082, 1041, 96782, 117370, 236881, 107, 178651, 2487