INFO 09-15 16:13:56 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-770421bbc570488cb7abb3e694d8daa3-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhen in eternal lines to time thou growest:\nAh! if thou issueless shalt hap to die.\nLord of my love, to whom in vassalage\nLo! thus, by day my limbs, by night my mind,\nAnd by a part of all thy glory live.\nAnd with old woes new wail my dear time's waste:\nThe bounteous largess given thee to give?\nSo then I am not lame, poor, nor despised,\nO, then vouchsafe me but this loving thought:\nHow can I then be elder than thou art?\nAnd your sweet semblance to some other give.\nThat am debarr'd the benefit of rest?\nWho with his fear is put besides his part,\nSo great a sum of sums, yet canst not live?\nAs those gold candles fix'd in heaven's air:\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nI sigh the lack of many a thing I sought,\nAs interest of the dead, which now appear\nHow can I then return in happy plight,\nThe bounteous largess given thee to give?\nBearing thy heart, which I will keep so chary\nVaunt in their youthful sap, at height decrease,\nBeauty's effect with beauty were bereft,\nWhy didst thou promise such a beauteous day,\nThat I an accessary needs must be\nRoses have thorns, and silver fountains mud;\nTill Nature, as she wrought thee, fell a-doting,\nTheirs for their style I'll read, his for his love.'\nIf the true concord of well-tuned sounds,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 4420, 528, 37187, 4463, 531, 990, 35627, 2171, 598, 236787, 107, 24019, 236888, 768, 35627, 2226, 122333, 145453, 47926, 531, 1778, 236761, 107, 52130, 529, 1041, 2765, 236764, 531, 8761, 528, 177363, 676, 107, 9520, 236888, 5478, 236764, 684, 1719, 1041, 50917, 236764, 684, 3446, 1041, 3666