INFO 09-15 16:14:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-cf6a261894414e3ba53cd1debf58bbb0-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nThose hours, that with gentle work did frame\nHim in thy course untainted do allow\nBy children's eyes her husband's shape in mind.\nGrant, if thou wilt, thou art beloved of many,\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nThe painful warrior famoused for fight,\nDesiring this man's art and that man's scope,\nNor can thy shame give physic to my grief;\nDesiring this man's art and that man's scope,\nAnd dumb presagers of my speaking breast,\nThat I an accessary needs must be\nOr say with princes if it shall go well,\nThat thou among the wastes of time must go,\nSince sweets and beauties do themselves forsake\nBearing thy heart, which I will keep so chary\nProving his beauty by succession thine!\nGilding the object whereupon it gazeth;\nAnd make the earth devour her own sweet brood;\nWhich in thy breast doth live, as thine in me:\nExcusing thy sins more than thy sins are;\nDuty so great, which wit so poor as mine\nNo longer yours than you yourself here live:\nNor lose possession of that fair thou owest;\nHim in thy course untainted do allow\nAnd loathsome canker lives in sweetest bud.\nAre windows to my breast, where-through the sun\nAnd barren rage of death's eternal cold?\nThe region cloud hath mask'd him from me now.\nHow much more praise deserved thy beauty's use,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 28587, 3885, 236764, 600, 607, 14617, 981, 1602, 5528, 107, 142437, 528, 21820, 3003, 2225, 25197, 776, 2174, 107, 2292, 2940, 236789, 236751, 6114, 1116, 8705, 236789, 236751, 6230, 528, 3666, 236761, 107, 67166, 236764, 768, 35627, 71438, 236764, 35627, 1610, 27867, 529, 1551, 2