INFO 09-15 16:14:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-57cb67d6b07a469b868bbbae36de4fed-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nHast thou, the master-mistress of my passion;\nMusic to hear, why hear'st thou music sadly?\nBut when in thee time's furrows I behold,\nTo let base clouds o'ertake me in my way,\nAnd shalt by fortune once more re-survey\nAnd they are rich and ransom all ill deeds.\nMake thee another self, for love of me,\nHow far I toil, still farther off from thee.\nWith what I most enjoy contented least;\nDie single, and thine image dies with thee.\nTo dry the rain on my storm-beaten face,\nLo! thus, by day my limbs, by night my mind,\nHow far I toil, still farther off from thee.\nMusic to hear, why hear'st thou music sadly?\nBeauty's effect with beauty were bereft,\nLet those who are in favour with their stars\nUnless thou take that honour from thy name:\nSo long lives this and this gives life to thee.\nThat I an accessary needs must be\nOf plagues, of dearths, or seasons' quality;\nAnd stretched metre of an antique song:\nFor thou art so possess'd with murderous hate\nWhen sparkling stars twire not thou gild'st the even.\nWhilst that this shadow doth such substance give\nNo longer yours than you yourself here live:\nBut out, alack! he was but one hour mine;\nFor shame! deny that thou bear'st love to any,\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nBut flowers distill'd though they with winter meet,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 202492, 35627, 236764, 506, 7588, 236772, 35768, 852, 529, 1041, 10631, 236793, 107, 24068, 531, 6899, 236764, 3217, 6899, 236789, 540, 35627, 4252, 46149, 236881, 107, 4573, 1056, 528, 44543, 990, 236789, 236751, 13969, 4290, 564, 67028, 236764, 107, 2021, 