INFO 09-15 16:14:08 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-09232f4dfd0944d7bccd8c88d4d3d5e6-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nIf I could write the beauty of your eyes\nMark how one string, sweet husband to another,\nAnd all in war with Time for love of you,\nOr else of thee this I prognosticate:\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nHast thou, the master-mistress of my passion;\nWhen I consider every thing that grows\nSo thou, thyself out-going in thy noon,\nAnd make the earth devour her own sweet brood;\nCheered and cheque'd even by the self-same sky,\nBut that thou none lovest is most evident;\nMake war upon this bloody tyrant, Time?\nMine be thy love and thy love's use their treasure.\nWhen in eternal lines to time thou growest:\nAttending on his golden pilgrimage;\nTheirs for their style I'll read, his for his love.'\nHim in thy course untainted do allow\nThen happy I, that love and am beloved\nThough yet, heaven knows, it is but as a tomb\nWhich this, Time's pencil, or my pupil pen,\nWhen I behold the violet past prime,\nIn thee thy summer, ere thou be distill'd:\nBy adding one thing to my purpose nothing.\nLook, what is best, that best I wish in thee:\nAnd dig deep trenches in thy beauty's field,\nAnd trouble deal heaven with my bootless cries\nHast thou, the master-mistress of my passion;\nAs tender nurse her babe from faring ill.\nYet, do thy worst, old Time: despite thy wrong,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2859, 564, 1451, 4903, 506, 9899, 529, 822, 6114, 107, 10666, 1217, 886, 2483, 236764, 9380, 8705, 531, 2264, 236764, 107, 3133, 784, 528, 3653, 607, 7578, 573, 2765, 529, 611, 236764, 107, 3524, 1663, 529, 44543, 672, 564, 41206, 731, 10982, 236787, 107, 236776, 7921, 41971, 11