INFO 09-15 16:14:20 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-728e1c02d64c4bdb855109aa9c20c401-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWith ugly rack on his celestial face,\nAnd having climb'd the steep-up heavenly hill,\nMine be thy love and thy love's use their treasure.\nDoth homage to his new-appearing sight,\nBut since he died and poets better prove,\nWhen day's oppression is not eased by night,\nSo thou through windows of thine age shall see\nThough in our lives a separable spite,\nOf public honour and proud titles boast,\nWhich I new pay as if not paid before.\nBut things removed that hidden in thee lie!\nWhen I consider every thing that grows\nLeaving thee living in posterity?\nEven so my sun one early morn did shine\nThe world will wail thee, like a makeless wife;\nAnd make me travel forth without my cloak,\nIf ten of thine ten times refigured thee:\nAnd they are rich and ransom all ill deeds.\nAs truth and beauty shall together thrive,\nBy chance or nature's changing course untrimm'd;\nThe one by toil, the other to complain\nLook in thy glass, and tell the face thou viewest\nWere an all-eating shame and thriftless praise.\nAnd then believe me, my love is as fair\nThou art thy mother's glass, and she in thee\nThe painful warrior famoused for fight,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nThose hours, that with gentle work did frame\nWho will believe my verse in time to come,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 3497, 37653, 25883, 580, 914, 83798, 3392, 236764, 107, 3133, 2963, 17085, 236789, 236753, 506, 25465, 236772, 1048, 67110, 17971, 236764, 107, 61781, 577, 21820, 2765, 532, 21820, 2765, 236789, 236751, 1161, 910, 37120, 236761, 107, 236796, 1235, 72525, 531, 914, 861, 236772, 199024, 14186, 