INFO 09-15 16:14:31 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-960e1fa7af54465b86529cf74bf4ad4a-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhere all the treasure of thy lusty days,\nHerein lives wisdom, beauty and increase:\nAnd that fresh blood which youngly thou bestowest\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nOr to thyself at least kind-hearted prove:\nShifts but his place, for still the world enjoys it;\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,\nThey draw but what they see, know not the heart.\nWhen every private widow well may keep\nHim in thy course untainted do allow\nThe painful warrior famoused for fight,\n'Had my friend's Muse grown with this growing age,\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nMy body is the frame wherein 'tis held,\nIn singleness the parts that thou shouldst bear.\nFor shame! deny that thou bear'st love to any,\nTill then not show my head where thou mayst prove me.\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nAnd loathsome canker lives in sweetest bud.\nLooking on darkness which the blind do see\nHerein lives wisdom, beauty and increase:\nWhose speechless song, being many, seeming one,\nThen may I dare to boast how I do love thee;\nLet them say more than like of hearsay well;\nBy unions married, do offend thine ear,\nFor never-resting time leads summer on\nThy bosom is endeared with all hearts,\nBut from thine eyes my knowledge I derive,\nFor thy sweet love remember'd such wealth brings<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 10936, 784, 506, 37120, 529, 21820, 47150, 236762, 2668, 236764, 107, 8291, 495, 6176, 23069, 236764, 9899, 532, 3553, 236787, 107, 3133, 600, 5756, 4806, 837, 3184, 586, 35627, 171130, 598, 107, 13185, 16126, 532, 15025, 18046, 618, 35627, 110783, 2367