INFO 09-15 16:14:32 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-918d83a7cb734142be5c520f27962ce6-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWhen day's oppression is not eased by night,\nWhich bounteous gift thou shouldst in bounty cherish:\nFor whether beauty, birth, or wealth, or wit,\nA woman's gentle heart, but not acquainted\nAs he takes from you, I engraft you new.\nAnd in fresh numbers number all your graces,\nKissing with golden face the meadows green,\nOr some fierce thing replete with too much rage,\nFor thou art so possess'd with murderous hate\nThen look I death my days should expiate.\nAnd summer's lease hath all too short a date:\nFrom his low tract and look another way:\nThen let not winter's ragged hand deface\nA man in hue, all 'hues' in his controlling,\nIf it were fill'd with your most high deserts?\nNot from the stars do I my judgment pluck;\nAnd all in war with Time for love of you,\nAgainst this coming end you should prepare,\nFor no man well of such a salve can speak\nFind no determination: then you were\nTo witness duty, not to show my wit:\nFor beauty's pattern to succeeding men.\nTo work my mind, when body's work's expired:\nAre windows to my breast, where-through the sun\nThen being ask'd where all thy beauty lies,\nBut if the while I think on thee, dear friend,\nBorne on the bier with white and bristly beard,\nTheir images I loved I view in thee,\nThat beauty still may live in thine or thee.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 4420, 1719, 236789, 236751, 65700, 563, 711, 99211, 684, 3446, 236764, 107, 24249, 518, 1522, 654, 806, 7963, 35627, 1374, 540, 528, 88039, 86327, 236787, 107, 2542, 3363, 9899, 236764, 6681, 236764, 653, 12821, 236764, 653, 32950, 236764, 107, 236776, 3875, 236789,