INFO 09-15 16:14:43 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-13973edbd6e64b428e5fdf87b2a2d007-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nIf ten of thine ten times refigured thee:\nAnd make me travel forth without my cloak,\nShall hate be fairer lodged than gentle love?\nWhich, like a jewel hung in ghastly night,\nAnd do whate'er thou wilt, swift-footed Time,\nSuns of the world may stain when heaven's sun staineth.\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nI all alone beweep my outcast state\nDo in consent shake hands to torture me;\nWhen to the sessions of sweet silent thought\nUnless thou take that honour from thy name:\nBy chance or nature's changing course untrimm'd;\nLord of my love, to whom in vassalage\nHow far I toil, still farther off from thee.\nAnd many maiden gardens yet unset\nDisdains the tillage of thy husbandry?\nSave that my soul's imaginary sight\nFor never-resting time leads summer on\nWhen I behold the violet past prime,\nO'ercharged with burden of mine own love's might.\nWhose fresh repair if now thou not renewest,\nAnd then believe me, my love is as fair\nNor can thy shame give physic to my grief;\nServing with looks his sacred majesty;\nLook, what an unthrift in the world doth spend\nIn one of thine, from that which thou departest;\nSo shall those blots that do with me remain\nLook, whom she best endow'd she gave the more;\nNow stand you on the top of happy hours,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 2859, 3595, 529, 162531, 3595, 2782, 544, 216357, 44543, 236787, 107, 3133, 1386, 786, 4301, 12034, 2180, 1041, 72527, 236764, 107, 172702, 17554, 577, 173410, 81060, 1082, 14617, 2765, 236881, 107, 24249, 236764, 1133, 496, 71102, 15410, 528, 29160, 224659, 3446, 236764, 107, 3133, 776, 615