 67%|██████▋   | 671/1000 [00:47<00:22, 14.76it/s]INFO 09-15 16:14:43 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-bf460a7ba6e34f579dec3b10f5189e72-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nReserve them for my love, not for their rhyme,\nBut when from highmost pitch, with weary car,\nLike to the lark at break of day arising\nNo longer yours than you yourself here live:\nSo thou, thyself out-going in thy noon,\nThe age to come would say 'This poet lies:\nOf plagues, of dearths, or seasons' quality;\nThis were to be new made when thou art old,\nThat hath his windows glazed with thine eyes.\nFor through the painter must you see his skill,\nAs I, not for myself, but for thee will;\nLest my bewailed guilt should do thee shame,\nOf plagues, of dearths, or seasons' quality;\nOr ten times happier, be it ten for one;\nBut since she prick'd thee out for women's pleasure,\nAs tender nurse her babe from faring ill.\nHow far I toil, still farther off from thee.\nWhich husbandry in honour might uphold\nWhen lofty trees I see barren of leaves\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nThey do but sweetly chide thee, who confounds\nFor at a frown they in their glory die.\nA liquid prisoner pent in walls of glass,\nI tell the day, to please them thou art bright\nThat thou among the wastes of time must go,\nHim in thy course untainted do allow\nBut thy eternal summer shall not fade\nIf it were fill'd with your most high deserts?\nCan make you live yourself in eyes of men.<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 133422, 1091, 573, 1041, 2765, 236764, 711, 573, 910, 117370, 236764, 107, 4573, 1056, 699, 1494, 3374, 12861, 236764, 607, 78567, 1295, 236764, 107, 17729, 531, 506, 218175, 657, 2541, 529, 1719, 27123, 107, 3771, 4890, 23149, 1