INFO 09-15 16:14:43 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-cf6d743ad77a4e3daf5000f0d6f84bae-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nWishing me like to one more rich in hope,\nFor thee and for myself no quiet find.\nHerein lives wisdom, beauty and increase:\nAs I, not for myself, but for thee will;\nBut do not so; I love thee in such sort\nMake glad and sorry seasons as thou fleets,\nThou art thy mother's glass, and she in thee\nIf from thyself to store thou wouldst convert;\nNor can I fortune to brief minutes tell,\nMaking a couplement of proud compare,\nCompare them with the bettering of the time,\nTake all my comfort of thy worth and truth.\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nYet in these thoughts myself almost despising,\nTo the wide world and all her fading sweets;\nIf all were minded so, the times should cease\nIs from the book of honour razed quite,\nAnd puts apparel on my tatter'd loving,\nIf thou survive my well-contented day,\nThen let not winter's ragged hand deface\nThat this huge stage presenteth nought but shows\nA woman's gentle heart, but not acquainted\nAnd there reigns love and all love's loving parts,\nLeaving thee living in posterity?\nNor shall Death brag thou wander'st in his shade,\nWhich, like a jewel hung in ghastly night,\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nHow much more praise deserved thy beauty's use,\nWhich erst from heat did canopy the herd,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 234207, 786, 1133, 531, 886, 919, 8326, 528, 4614, 236764, 107, 2542, 44543, 532, 573, 7564, 951, 12010, 1586, 236761, 107, 8291, 495, 6176, 23069, 236764, 9899, 532, 3553, 236787, 107, 2205, 564, 236764, 711, 573, 7564, 236764, 840, 573, 44543, 795, 236793, 107, 4573, 776, 711, 834, 