INFO 09-15 16:14:43 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-66691df283a94dfeb1ab90a032e56b3c-0: prompt: "<bos><start_of_turn>user\nPick as many lines as you can from these poem lines:\nFROM fairest creatures we desire increase,\nThat thereby beauty's rose might never die,\nBut as the riper should by time decease,\nHis tender heir might bear his memory:\nBut thou, contracted to thine own bright eyes,\nFeed'st thy light'st flame with self-substantial fuel,\nMaking a famine where abundance lies,\nThyself thy foe, to thy sweet self too cruel.\nThou that art now the world's fresh ornament\nAnd only herald to the gaudy spring,\nWithin thine own bud buriest thy content\nAnd, tender churl, makest waste in niggarding.\nPity the world, or else this glutton be,\nTo eat the world's due, by the grave and thee.\nAuthorizing thy trespass with compare,\nSuch heavenly touches ne'er touch'd earthly faces.'\nThat thou among the wastes of time must go,\nThy unused beauty must be tomb'd with thee,\nSometime too hot the eye of heaven shines,\nThat this huge stage presenteth nought but shows\nTill then not show my head where thou mayst prove me.\nWhen in eternal lines to time thou growest:\nDespite of wrinkles this thy golden time.\nWhen that churl Death my bones with dust shall cover,\nThen happy I, that love and am beloved\nThey draw but what they see, know not the heart.\nAs truth and beauty shall together thrive,\nGilding pale streams with heavenly alchemy;\nThen what could death do, if thou shouldst depart,\nO'ercharged with burden of mine own love's might.\nIf ten of thine ten times refigured thee:\nProving his beauty by succession thine!\nFor no man well of such a salve can speak\nThen of thy beauty do I question make,\nLet those whom Nature hath not made for store,\nShall I compare thee to a summer's day?\nServing with looks his sacred majesty;\nBeauty's effect with beauty were bereft,\nAlthough our undivided loves are one:\nNor thou with public kindness honour me,\nBut do not so; I love thee in such sort\nWith ugly rack on his celestial face,\nAnd look upon myself and curse my fate,<end_of_turn>\n<start_of_turn>model\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=150, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [2, 2, 105, 2364, 107, 42407, 618, 1551, 4463, 618, 611, 740, 699, 1239, 27355, 4463, 236787, 107, 28337, 12221, 540, 28682, 692, 12614, 3553, 236764, 107, 6372, 17534, 9899, 236789, 236751, 11076, 2473, 2752, 1778, 236764, 107, 4573, 618, 506, 3382, 721, 1374, 684, 990, 20401, 781, 236764, 107, 15989, 21870, 49967, 2473, 10591, 914, 6571, 236787, 107, 4573, 35627, 236764, 45987, 531, 162531, 1852, 7804, 6114, 236764, 107, 28923, 236789, 540, 21820, 2214, 236789, 540, 27400, 607, 1265, 236772, 189395, 7611, 236764, 107, 41950, 496, 93263, 1298, 26444, 12828, 236764, 107, 1214, 986, 883, 21820, 95521, 236764, 531, 21820, 9380, 1265, 2311, 34381, 236761, 107, 178651, 600, 1610, 1492, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 5756, 20794, 107, 3133, 1186, 81319, 531, 506, 11557, 66632, 6247, 236764, 107, 43794, 162531, 1852, 5207, 5717, 15163, 21820, 3004, 107, 3133, 236764, 21870, 677, 2451, 236764, 17216, 598, 8321, 528, 116063, 23485, 236761, 107, 236791, 665, 506, 1902, 236764, 653, 1663, 672, 2112, 1654, 577, 236764, 107, 2021, 9039, 506, 1902, 236789, 236751, 2779, 236764, 684, 506, 23674, 532, 44543, 236761, 107, 14953, 4266, 21820, 80922, 607, 10769, 236764, 107, 28576, 67110, 33466, 770, 236789, 497, 6374, 236789, 236753, 92872, 13799, 7085, 107, 6372, 35627, 3571, 506, 45062, 529, 990, 1921, 817, 236764, 107, 195297, 50781, 9899, 1921, 577, 44064, 236789, 236753, 607, 44543, 23